ist sidebar into statically composed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Service Procs and Scheduled Routines panels over the unchanged global [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]_axe_items index, with metadata titles, focus chrome, shared height [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]allocation, width settling, scheduler-fold removal, docs, glossary [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strands, tests, and visual goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Phase 2: J / K panel jumps on the Services tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]service-panel-jk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after service-panels[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]service-panel-jk: add tab-scoped focus_next/prev_service_panel keymaps [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on J/K that select the first/last node of the adjacent non-empty panel [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with wrap, plus availability gating, palette/help/docs discoverability, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-17a","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-17a.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-17a.1"},"source_run_id":"run-cde5710856d1a945a20f65f4910b096e","started_at":"2026-09-23T22:28:51.083271+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-17a","bbugyi200.athena.sase-17a.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-17a.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-17a.land"]}
